                <pb facs="0747" n="736" sameAs="frus:frus1937v02/pg736"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.6363 Amiranian/8: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Iran</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Merriam</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-01-18T09:00:00+03:25">January 18, 1937—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received January 18—7:43 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3. My No. 2, January 11, noon. The two concessions were presented to the Mejlis
                    yesterday. Ratification procedure is expected to occupy about 2 weeks. The texts
                    are being published in the local press.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merriam</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
